// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Twinshot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P507186409" "Twinshot"
// ProfessionString :
"P312629277" "Pistol-Packing Powerhouse"
// DescriptionString :
"P2655860849" "Twinshot has a heart of gold, and bullets of iron.  Don't give her any sass and you'll be perfectly fine."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P2598201680" "Hey there, {HeroName}.  Got something on your mind?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3586065143" "Sorry, kiddo, but this is the cool kids' table.  Not saying you're not cool, but hey, you know how it is."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3109751820" "Hey there, kiddo.  I've caught sight of you recently and figured maybe you might want some buddies to hang out with."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P392155287" "Hey, kiddo, long time no see. You keepin' busy, fighting crime, all that good stuff? Good, good...<br><br>Hey, I won't keep ya. No sense hanging around jabbering with me when there's work to be done, you know?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3442277341" "Looks like you're juggling a lot of hot potatoes. If hot potatoes were missions for other people is what I'm saying.  Wow... I think I just made Dillo sound coherent.  Come back when you've got less things on your plate and I might have a better catchy saying --- no promises."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P3486543930" "You should go meet Twinshot. She's been on the lookout for new heroes, and she's taken a real interest in you lately."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P996352585" "Meet Twinshot and the gang."
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1675404280" "Twinshot has a heart of gold, and bullets of iron. Don't give her any sass and you'll be perfectly fine."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P4097356788" "Hey, kiddo. I met someone interesting a while back, and I thought you might like an introduction."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P152595357" "Hey, kiddo. I met some interesting people a while back, and I thought you might like to meet them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - ComeBackLaterTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Act3 Text :
"P1011398557" "I... I need some time to unwind, kiddo. That mission in Galaxy took more out of me than I thought it would.<br><br>Look, why don't you come back later... say, when you're Level 15ish. Just give me some time."
// Page Act2 Text :
"P2687163957" "Looks like we're movin' on up, you know, like those President guys.  Or something like that.  That was totally way before my time, you know?  What I do know is that we're going to need some time to set up our new base. Swing by and talk to me when you're Level 10, and we can check out the new digs."
// Page Flashback Text :
"P147837712" "You know what, kid? Way back when, you and I might have had a good time hanging out, looking cool. Now, though, I think that time's long past.<br><br>You've got your future ahead of you, and so do I. No sense looking back to the past, wondering what coulda been, you know?<br><br><color skyblue>You have become too high level to continue the Shining Stars storyline. If you wish to go back and play these missions, visit Ouroboros (available at level 15) to complete each arc in order.</color>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


