// HelloString :
"P641875339" "Hey there, {HeroName}.  Got something on your mind, or do you just wanna hang looking cool?"
// IDontKnowYouString :
// FirstVisitString :
"P3934400284" "Hey there, kiddo.  I've caught sight of you recently and figured maybe you might want some buddies to hang out with?"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1563842922" "Looks like we're movin' on up, you know, like those President guys.  Or something like that.  That was totally way before my time, you know?  What I do know is that you need to skootch your rear-end over to Kings' Row and chat with me there."
// PlayerBusyString :
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P234094144" "You know, kid, I like you and all... But I ain't gonna coddle you. You may know a thing or two, but what I've got is mind is going to need some extra oomph, you know?  Why don't you stop by you've hit a higher Security Level, okay?"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3833917843" "I'm not the kinda gal who hands out her digits so easily, you know?  Now that we're friends, I might be open to giving them to you.  Let's hang out a bit more, then I'll think about it."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1474000008" "You're good people, know that?  Here are my digits if you need to get ahold of me anytime.  Might save you some wear and tear on those nifty treads of yours, eh?"
